		if (!trimmed) {
			return;
		}
		const enabledModels = form.getFieldValue('enabledModels');
		if (!enabledModels.includes(trimmed)) {
			form.setFieldValue('enabledModels', [...enabledModels, trimmed]);
		}
		setCustomModelInput('');
	};
```

Duplicate IDs are ignored rather than added twice, and the input is cleared either way. Lint passes with only pre-existing warnings in unrelated files.
